{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S02-0-6\",\n      \"also\": 2,\n      \"why\": \"时间一直向前，让当下的安稳带上了即将逝去的惆怅，正对应另一组对美好时刻将结束的舍不得。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S03-1-1\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"念头刚冒出来又沉回去，正是从想开口退回到另一组所写的舒服沉默。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S04-0-1\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"忍不住反复补说，和另一组几乎想把藏着的话全说出来，是同一股表达冲动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S04-1-2\",\n      \"also\": 2,\n      \"why\": \"情绪打开又收住，正对应另一组害怕说得太多而把话重新留住的矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S05-1-1\",\n      \"also\": 2,\n      \"why\": \"从亲密关系中退回自己的内心，和另一组担心原本的亲近忽然隔了一层是同一种疏离感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S09-2-1\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"不安暂时退到一旁，仍然承接着另一组对被拒绝、失去陪伴的担忧。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S10-0-2\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"明亮得想哭，和另一组亮堂得想笑又想哭，是同一种情绪释放。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S10-0-3\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"长长呼气、胸腔打开，直接对应另一组先前紧绷终于慢慢松开的感受。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S11-0-0\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"不再为自己的感情道歉，正是另一组高兴得顾不上害臊、不再觉得在乎对方有什么不好。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S11-0-4\",\n      \"also\": 2,\n      \"why\": \"越珍贵越心疼，直接落在另一组因未来无法确定而被欢喜压得心口发疼的感受上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S12-2-1\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"抱紧了不松手，把另一组还想多陪对方一会儿、不愿结束当下的愿望具体化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S13-0-0\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"一停下来就怕失去，正是另一组担心亲近终会消失、想提前把喜欢藏回去的原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S13-1-1\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"握住才害怕失去，和另一组渴望得到长久保证却明知无法保证，是同一层失去焦虑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S14-2-0\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"把开头没说完的话终于说完，正好回应另一组回想起最初不敢多露一点喜欢的自己。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dd4bfa94-a9fa-4f1e-94fd-f08cfede01f4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T160730408087Z", "elapsed_seconds": 179.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T16:10:29.478109+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "993a558d86c369fafd3c80566368e451d7e865e0720767f92cbff3482a00cbc2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T160730408087Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "7f5e61a2dc014e6